   "y": 823,
   "width": 252,
   "height": 135,
   "text": "no accounts collection\n\nBalance is read live from\nPlaid on every request \u2014\nit is the source of truth,\nnever a cached copy.\n\ndrift  =  \u03a3 goalAllocations\n            \u2212  live savings balance",
