  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "notes_h",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1312,
   "width": 411,
   "height": 17,
   "text": "DESIGN DECISIONS  \u2014  deltas from the first sketch",
   "originalText": "DESIGN DECISIONS  \u2014  deltas from the first sketch",
   "fontSize": 14,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#3b82f6",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11757,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11764,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "note_0",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1344,
   "width": 982,
   "height": 16,
   "text": "1   Rank lives in artistSnapshots, not on the artist doc.  One read for the leaderboard instead of 488, and every past ranking",
   "originalText": "1   Rank lives in artistSnapshots, not on the artist doc.  One read for the leaderboard instead of 488, and every past ranking",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11771,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11778,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "note_1",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1365,
   "width": 444,
   "height": 16,
   "text": "     survives the next sync instead of being overwritten.",
   "originalText": "     survives the next sync instead of being overwritten.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11785,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11792,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "note_2",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1386,
   "width": 982,
   "height": 16,
   "text": "2   Plaid re-sync must never clobber a manual category.  Merge on `modified`, honour `removed`, resume from the stored cursor.",
   "originalText": "2   Plaid re-sync must never clobber a manual category.  Merge on `modified`, honour `removed`, resume from the stored cursor.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11799,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11806,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "note_3",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1407,
   "width": 1006,
   "height": 16,
   "text": "3   budgets holds ONE active plan with lines[], not one doc per category \u2014 so \"only one active\" is enforceable in a single place.",
   "originalText": "3   budgets holds ONE active plan with lines[], not one doc per category \u2014 so \"only one active\" is enforceable in a single place.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11813,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11820,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "note_4",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1428,
   "width": 951,
   "height": 16,
   "text": "4   financialGoals is missing targetAmount; without it progress % cannot be computed.  goalAllocations keeps amountSaved a",
   "originalText": "4   financialGoals is missing targetAmount; without it progress % cannot be computed.  goalAllocations keeps amountSaved a",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11827,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11834,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "groupIds": [],
   "boundElements": null,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25
  },
  {
   "type": "text",
   "id": "note_5",
   "x": 80,
   "y": 1449,
   "width": 663,
   "height": 16,
   "text": "     derived, auditable, reversible number \u2014 and lets a deficit month draw back down.",
   "originalText": "     derived, auditable, reversible number \u2014 and lets a deficit month draw back down.",
   "fontSize": 13,
   "fontFamily": 3,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "strokeColor": "#64748b",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 1,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "angle": 0,
   "seed": 11841,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 11848,
   "isDeleted": false,
